You may implement the KT3 / KT4 file format in any software, commercial or not, without
asking for permission. When you share or adapt the documents themselves, give credit to
"keitodaze" and link to this repository.

This license covers the specification only. It does not cover:

- the KT3 Player and KT3 Creator applications, which have their own terms;
- the names "KT3", "KT3 Player" and "KT3 Creator". You may say that your software
  "supports KT3 / KT4 files", but please do not use these names in a way that suggests
  your software is KT3 Player or KT3 Creator, or is made by keitodaze.

